  "bodyText": "CL\n\nvancouver, BC >\n\nvancouver >\n\nhousing >\n\napartments / housing for rent\n\npost\naccount\nreply \nfavorite\n \nhide\n \n⚐\nflag\n \n\nshare\n\nPosted 6 days ago\n\nprint\n$5,475 / 2br - 850ft2 - Fully Furnished Designer 2BR/2BA Coach House (Arbutus / Kits / UBC / Point Grey)\n3260 W 16 Ave, Vancouver, BC V6K3E3\n© craigslist - Map data © OpenStreetMap\n3260 W 16 Ave near Blenheim\n2BR / 1.5Ba 850ft2 available oct 1\nrent period: monthly\ncats are OK - purrr\nhouse\ndogs are OK - wooof\nw/d in unit\nfurnished\nstreet parking\nno smoking\nair conditioning\nEV charging\nExperience upscale Westside living in this fully furnished, designer-appointed 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom coach house located at W 16th Ave & Blenheim St. Nestled on the vibrant border of Kitsilano, Arbutus, and Point Grey, this private residence offers premium finishes, air conditioning, and a fully equipped home gym.\n\nWhether you are a relocating professional, a visiting academic, or exploring the Lower Mainland, this turn-key home serves as your ultimate luxury Vancouver base.\n\nPremium Features & Interior Amenities\n\n* Chef's Kitchen: Equipped with stainless steel appliances, premium stone countertops, and custom millwork.\n* Climate Control: Stay comfortable year-round with built-in air conditioning (AC).\n* Luxury Millwork: Features elegant custom millwork and high-end built-ins throughout the home.\n* Entertainment & Living: Relax in a living space featuring a comfortable sofa bed (perfect for guests) and two large HD smart TVs.\n* Private Fitness Center: Access a fully equipped home gym complete with a premium functional trainer.\n\nOutdoor Living & Entry\n\n* Private Deck: Includes premium exterior patio furniture, a dining table, and a BBQ for effortless outdoor dining.\n* Serene Entry: Features a private entrance adjacent to a beautifully landscaped, tranquil backyard.\n\nPrime Westside Location\n\n* Neighborhoods: Steps from Kitsilano, Arbutus Ridge, and Point Grey.\n* Proximity to UBC: Minutes away from the University of British Columbia—ideal for faculty, medical professionals, or researchers.\n* Nature & Recreation: Easy access to local beaches, Pacific Spirit Regional Park forest trails, and neighborhood parks.\n* Shopping & Dining: Surrounded by the trendy boutiques, cafes, and restaurants of West 4th, West Broadway, and West 10th Ave.\n* Transit & Travel: Central location with seamless transit options to explore Downtown Vancouver and the entire Lower Mainland.\n\nRental Details & Inclusions\n\n* All-Inclusive Living: Monthly rent includes high-speed Wi-Fi, all utilities, and hot water.\n* Parking & Power: Comes with dedicated EV charging capabilities.\n* Lease Terms: Minimum 3-month stay.\n\n\npost id: 7967911446\n\n \n\nposted: 6 days ago\n\n \n\nupdated: about 11 hours ago\n\n \n\n♥ best of [?]\n\nhelp\nsafety\nprivacy\nterms\nabout\napp\n© 2026 craigslist",
